#: docs/explanation/source-map.md:14
msgid ""
"The physical layout groups Arm CPU implementations by ISA and MCU packages "
"by vendor. Family identifiers, public include paths and explicit target "
"names remain stable. These are source ownership groups, not runtime "
"forwarding layers."
msgstr ""
"物理目录按 ISA 分组 Arm CPU 实现，按厂家分组 MCU "
"包。系列标识、公共头路径和显式目标名称保持稳定。这些分组表达源码所有权，不是运行时转发层。"

#: docs/explanation/source-map.md:18
msgid ""
"Historical development collections are retained in the [evidence "
"archive](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/docs/archive/evidence/README.md) with exact member identities and "
"restore instructions. Their original source and execution scope remain "
"unchanged; archive restoration does not establish current-source "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"历史开发集合保存在[证据归档](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/docs/archive/evidence/README.md)中，附有精确成员身份和恢复步骤。其原始源码与执行范围保持不变；恢复归档不建立当前源码的资格。"

#: arch/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Public headers remain in `include/nexus/arch/`. Arm Cortex-M implementation "
"sources live in `arm/cortex_m/`, and host primitives live in `native/`. The "
"ISA directory is a build-time ownership boundary; CPU facts select one "
"implementation without a runtime CPU factory. A new architecture needs its "
"own reviewed implementation and compiler contract rather than a placeholder "
"support claim."
msgstr ""
"公共头仍位于 `include/nexus/arch/`。Arm Cortex-M 实现源码位于 `arm/cortex_m/`，主机原语位于 "
"`native/`。ISA 目录是构建期所有权边界；CPU 事实选择一个实现，不设置运行时 CPU "
"factory。新架构需要自身经过审查的实现和编译器合同，不能以占位声明代替支持。"

#: io/README.md:2
msgid "Typed I/O contracts and shared mechanisms"
msgstr "类型化 I/O 合同与共享机制"

#: io/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Public C11 interfaces cover GPIO, UART, SPI, I2C, physical Flash, watchdog, "
"interrupt/timer/acquisition mechanisms, CAN, USB, Ethernet and selected "
"RTC/LPTIM contracts. The [derived capability "
"matrix](/delivery/capabilities.md) identifies actual provider modes and "
"reviewed routes. An interface header alone does not provide every operation "
"on every chip or authorize PCB wiring."
msgstr ""
"公共 C11 接口覆盖 GPIO、UART、SPI、I2C、物理 Flash、watchdog、中断／定时／采集机制、CAN、USB、Ethernet "
"和选定的 RTC／LPTIM 合同。[派生能力矩阵](/delivery/capabilities.md)标明实际 provider "
"模式和已审路由。仅有接口头文件不代表每款芯片提供全部操作，也不授权 PCB 接线。"

