#: io/README.md:20
msgid ""
"Every selected instance has a readonly face containing shared readonly "
"methods and an independent private context. On a 32-bit target the face "
"occupies eight bytes of readonly storage; method tables, mutable state, "
"selected buffers and linked code have separate costs. Generated instances "
"use exact static storage; explicit constructors use storage provided by "
"their owner. Public consumers receive no vendor register layout or SDK state"
" type."
msgstr ""
"每个所选实例拥有一个只读 face，其中包含共享只读方法和独立私有 context。在 32 位目标上，face "
"占用八字节只读存储；方法表、可变状态、所选缓冲和链接代码的成本分别计算。生成实例使用精确静态存储；显式构造器使用其所有者供给的存储。公共消费者不会获得厂商寄存器布局或"
" SDK 状态类型。"

#: io/README.md:27
msgid ""
"Public operations validate the face and dispatch `ops(context, ...)`. "
"Providers can use direct private calls within their register hot paths. A "
"missing optional method reports `NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`. Different "
"provider/mode tables coexist without replacing public symbols. IRQ entries "
"are fixed to the selected concrete instances and do not look up a factory "
"for each byte."
msgstr ""
"公共操作校验 face，再分派 `ops(context, ...)`。provider 可在寄存器热路径内使用私有直接调用。缺失的可选方法返回 "
"`NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`。不同 provider／模式的方法表可并存，无须替换公共符号。IRQ "
"入口固定连接所选具体实例，不逐字节查询 factory。"

#: io/README.md:33
msgid ""
"Generated factory getters return existing identities. Lookup, Platform "
"start, request admission, service, recovery and stop remain separate "
"actions. Controller and endpoint identities stay distinct for SPI/I2C buses."
" New products should use the generated strong-reference header; see the "
"[factory contract](/explanation/factory.md) for headers and ID lifetime."
msgstr ""
"生成的 factory getter 返回已有身份。查找、Platform 启动、请求接纳、service、恢复和停止仍是独立动作。SPI／I2C "
"总线的控制器与端点身份保持独立。新产品应使用生成的强类型引用头；头文件和 ID 生命周期参见 [factory "
"合同](/explanation/factory.md)。"

#: io/README.md:39
msgid ""
"The direct path has one serialized executor in each operation's allowed "
"context. Requests and transfer buffers remain caller-owned through acquire-"
"observed SETTLED. Cancel, deadline and failed drain never revoke a borrow. A"
" provider withdraws hardware, IRQ and deferred references before its final "
"release publication; QUARANTINED storage and cleanup responsibility remain "
"retained. The [ownership table](/explanation/ownership.md) distinguishes "
"direct calls, fixed IRQ work, cross-task adapters, waiting and shutdown."
msgstr ""
"直接路径在每项操作允许的上下文中由单一串行执行者推进。请求与传输缓冲由调用者拥有，并须保持到 acquire 观察 "
"SETTLED。取消、deadline 和排空失败绝不撤销借用。provider 在最终 release 发布前撤回硬件、IRQ "
"和延迟引用；QUARANTINED 存储与清理责任继续保留。[所有权表](/explanation/ownership.md)区分直接调用、固定 IRQ"
" 工作、跨任务 adapter、等待和停机。"

#: io/README.md:47
msgid ""
"Stream reserve, publish, acquire, release, abort and stop access a constant "
"amount of metadata independent of block count. Stop checks the outstanding "
"count and does not scan or revoke borrowed blocks under an interrupt mask. "
"Cold storage-overlap validation examines the complete selected block set; it"
" has a different cost. These software complexity contracts do not establish "
"physical IRQ latency."
msgstr ""
"stream 的 reserve、publish、acquire、release、abort 和 stop 访问的元数据数量固定，与块数无关。stop "
"检查未归还计数，不在中断屏蔽期间扫描或撤销借出的块。冷态存储重叠校验检查完整所选块集合，具有不同成本。这些软件复杂度合同不建立物理 IRQ 延迟资格。"

#: io/README.md:53
msgid ""
"DMA memory completion, peripheral wire completion and request settlement are"
" separate facts. Providers check exact DMA reachability, selected domains, "
"Cache ownership and real source withdrawal. Finite and continuous modes have"
" distinct loan/rearm/backpressure contracts. Default paths add no mandatory "
"OS locks, hidden driver tasks or universal buffer pools. The [DMA and stream"
" contracts](/design/io-evolution.md) own exact scope."
msgstr ""
"DMA 内存完成、外设线上完成和请求结清是不同事实。provider 检查精确 DMA 可达性、所选域、Cache "
"所有权和真实源撤回。有限模式与连续模式具有不同借用／重装／背压合同。默认路径不增加强制 OS 锁、隐藏驱动任务或通用缓冲池。精确范围由 [DMA 与 "
"stream 合同](/design/io-evolution.md)规定。"

#: io/README.md:60
msgid ""
"The optional [USB activation contract](/design/usb-device.md) keeps a "
"separate immutable activation face and the existing provider context. Its "
"selected nonzero endpoint setter is a bounded controller action; external "
"Chapter 9 policy owns configuration, rollback and ordinary packet admission."
" It adds no default worker or configuration transaction. The public "
"declaration retains its context, partial-effect and full-stop obligations."
msgstr ""
"可选 [USB 激活合同](/design/usb-device.md)保留独立不可变激活 face 和已有 provider "
"context。其所选非零端点 setter 是有界控制器动作；外部 Chapter 9 政策拥有配置、回退和普通数据包接纳责任。它不增加默认 "
"worker 或配置事务。公共声明继续规定上下文、部分效果和完整停止义务。"

#: io/README.md:67
msgid ""
"Native, production-register models, selected ARM links and physical HIL "
"establish different evidence. Independent instance state and source-"
"directory organization do not establish electrical behavior, measured timing"
" or losslessness under arbitrary load. MCU physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"Native、生产寄存器模型、所选 ARM 链接和实物 HIL "
"分别建立不同证据。独立实例状态和源码目录组织不能证明电气行为、实测时序或任意负载下无丢失。MCU 实物 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`。"

#: os/README.md:9
msgid ""
"The common public abstraction is the wait/wake port. Task, queue, join and "
"storage APIs are deliberately backend-specific and expose the selected "
"kernel's real control-block requirements. A product switching kernels adapts"
" its task lifecycle explicitly; the platform supplies no universal "
"Task/Queue ABI or maximum storage pool."
msgstr ""
"共同公共抽象是等待／唤醒端口。任务、队列、join 和存储 API "
"有意采用后端专用形式，暴露所选内核的真实控制块要求。产品切换内核时显式适配任务生命周期；平台不提供通用 Task／Queue ABI 或最大存储池。"

#: components/README.md:9
msgid ""
"General mechanisms remain in their named component directories. Exact STM32 "
"extensions live under `components/soc/stm32/`, including selected F407 "
"handoff/I2S2 and U575 retained-time/LPDMA/Stop2 mechanisms. Their public "
"include paths and explicit target names stay stable. This source grouping "
"does not broaden the supported chip, backend, clock, security or physical "
"qualification scope."
msgstr ""
"通用机制保留在各自命名的组件目录。精确 STM32 扩展位于 `components/soc/stm32/`，包括所选 F407 "
"handoff／I2S2 和 U575 retained-time／LPDMA／Stop2 "
"机制。其公共头路径和显式目标名称保持稳定。这种源码分组不会扩大支持的芯片、后端、时钟、安全域或实物资格范围。"

#: soc/README.md:2
msgid "SoC packages and private providers"
msgstr "SoC 包与私有 provider"

#: soc/README.md:4
msgid ""
"MCU source ownership follows the vendor and exact maintained family. Public "
"family identifiers such as `stm32f407` and `gd32f470` remain unchanged. The "
"maintained family descriptor supplies the canonical source directory; "
"directory names do not create another configuration authority or a runtime "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"MCU 源码所有权按厂家和精确维护系列划分。`stm32f407`、`gd32f470` "
"等公共系列标识保持不变。维护中的系列描述符提供规范源码目录；目录名称不产生另一份配置权威或运行时登记表。"

#: soc/README.md:20
msgid ""
"Each MCU family owns `soc.json`, `routes.json`, its private controller "
"state, selected driver sources and explicit CMake targets. Startup, clocks, "
"timebase, memory and power code remain with that family. Common register "
"algorithms are shared only after every wrapper checks the real vendor "
"layout, bits, clocks, IRQ/DMA routes and errata. Similar peripheral names do"
" not establish equivalence."
msgstr ""
"每个 MCU 系列拥有 `soc.json`、`routes.json`、私有控制器状态、所选驱动源码和显式 CMake "
"目标。启动、时钟、时间基准、内存和电源代码仍归该系列所有。只有各包装层分别检查真实厂商寄存器布局、位、时钟、IRQ／DMA "
"路由和勘误后，才共享通用寄存器算法。相似的外设名称不能证明实现等价。"

#: soc/README.md:26
msgid ""
"`native/drivers/` implements the public I/O contracts as independent host "
"models; it does not establish MCU timing or electrical behavior. `common/` "
"remains cross-vendor because its reviewed algorithms serve both STM32 and "
"GD32."
msgstr ""
"`native/drivers/` 用独立主机模型实现公共 I/O 合同，不建立 MCU 时序或电气行为资格。`common/` "
"保持跨厂家归属，因为其中经过审查的算法同时服务 STM32 和 GD32。"

#: soc/README.md:30
msgid ""
"The [Board packages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/README.md) authorize reviewed PCB bindings. "
"Adding a Board does not enable a new clock tree automatically: select an "
"exact maintained clock profile, or implement and verify another profile. "
"Keep unsupported oscillators, domains, modes and silicon revisions explicit."
msgstr ""
"[Board 包](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/boards/README.md)授权经过审查的 PCB 绑定。增加 Board 不会自动启用新的时钟树：应选择精确维护的时钟 "
"profile，或实现并验证另一 profile。不支持的晶振、域、模式和硅片修订须明确保留。"

#: soc/README.md:35
msgid ""
"Use the [provider guide](/guides/provider-porting.md) for implementation, "
"the [derived matrix](/delivery/capabilities.md) for selected routes and "
"modes, and the [qualification guide](/reference/platforms/qualification.md) "
"for actual evidence. CPU support, SDK macros and source-directory presence "
"do not establish whole-family support. MCU physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"实现遵循 [provider 指南](/guides/provider-"
"porting.md)，所选路由和模式参见[派生矩阵](/delivery/capabilities.md)，实际证据参见[资格指南](/reference/platforms/qualification.md)。CPU"
" 支持、SDK 宏和源码目录存在均不建立整个系列的支持资格。MCU 实物 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`。"

#: docs/explanation/source-map.md:95
msgid "Board packages"
msgstr "Board 包"

#: boards/README.md:2
msgid "Reviewed Board facts"
msgstr "经过审查的 Board 事实"

#: boards/README.md:4
msgid ""
"A Board package records PCB/source identity, the exact SoC, oscillators, "
"reviewed controller bindings, safe initial levels, reserved resources, "
"provenance and explicitly unknown electrical facts. It reuses the selected "
"[SoC provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/README.md); it does not copy drivers or vendor SDKs."
msgstr ""
"Board 包记录 PCB／来源身份、精确 SoC、晶振、已审控制器绑定、安全初始电平、保留资源、资料来源，以及明确未知的电气事实。它复用所选 [SoC"
" provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/README.md)，不复制驱动或厂商 SDK。"

#: boards/README.md:15
msgid ""
"Private PCB packages belong in external product repositories and are "
"selected through `board_package`. Maintained public packages are selected "
"through `board`. Keep the family identifier independent of the "
"manufacturer's physical directory. Board declarations cannot change a chip's"
" memory geometry or enable an unmaintained clock profile, DMA route or "
"controller mode."
msgstr ""
"私有 PCB 包属于外部产品仓库，通过 `board_package` 选择。维护中的公共包通过 `board` "
"选择。系列标识须独立于厂家的物理目录。Board 声明不能改变芯片内存几何，也不能启用未维护的时钟 profile、DMA 路由或控制器模式。"

#: boards/README.md:21
msgid ""
"Start with an exact part and a small reviewed route set, then follow the "
"[Board porting guide](/guides/board-porting.md). A syntactically valid JSON "
"file does not establish fitted components, connector continuity, power "
"supply or physical timing. Uninspected PCB revisions and jumpers remain "
"unknown; software fixtures do not qualify a real PCB. MCU physical HIL "
"remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"从精确料号和少量已审路由开始，再遵循 [Board 接入指南](/guides/board-porting.md)。JSON "
"语法有效不能证明器件装配、连接器导通、电源或物理时序。未检查的 PCB 修订和跳线仍为未知；软件夹具不建立真实 PCB 的资格。MCU 实物 HIL "
"仍为 `not_executed`。"
